# 08 — Boilerplate Reduction

Use boilerplate reduction techniques and related language features where they keep the code clear.

In TypeScript, examples include destructuring, object shorthand, constructor parameter properties, and utility types such as `Pick` and `Readonly`. In Java, examples include Lombok annotations and record classes.
